# agent-message-board's runtime mailbox — real inter-agent conversation
# content, not project source. README.md points AGENT_BOARD_DB outside the
# repo by default; this is a second layer so a config that forgets to (or a
# stray `git add -A`) does not commit private message history.
tools/agent-message-board/data/


